{"type":"Film","id":"FR2016_183","slug":"fr2016-183-pere-fils-therapie","title":{"native":"Père fils thérapie !","english":"Father-son Boot Camp"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-12-28","year":2016},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":["Emile Gaudreault"],"genre":["Comedy"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/254/146/168702/format_page/pere-fils-therapie.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BvukcLNCUqg"},"synopsis":{"native":"Ils sont père et fils. Ils ne se supportent pas. Leurs entourages leur ont lancé un ultimatum : participer à un stage de réconciliation « Aventures Père Fils » dans les gorges du Verdon où ils devront tenter un ultime rapprochement. Entre mauvaise foi et coups bas, pas évident qu’ils arrivent à se réconcilier.","english":"They are father and son. They can't stand each other. Their friends and family member have launched an ultimatum: they must participate in a reconciliation workshop \"Father Son Adventures\" in the gorges of the Verdon, where they must attempt to draw closer one last time. Between bad faith and underhand tactics, it's not sure they'll survive the adventure and manage to become reunited."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Canada","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2016_183_01","film":"FR2016_183","person":{"id":"Richard Berry","slug":"richard-berry","name":"Richard Berry","birthYear":1950,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"age":"3: Third Age (60-75)","gender":"Male identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Upper Middle class","profession":"Retired","ability":"Able-bodied","assistedMobility":"No"}],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Féodor Atkine","slug":"feodor-atkine","name":"Féodor Atkine","birthYear":1948,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Jacq